Fresh adversarial review of F2's uncommitted diff (git diff HEAD plus untracked) against ${W}/packet.md acceptance, the F2 Decided text in docs/27-v1.4.md, 02 §1 invariants, R1–R14 and the 15-reference tables. Check the claims yourself: run the new unit test, docTables, the goldens and the gallery e2e spec. Write ${W}/review-3.md and review-3.json (rounds 1–2 were the empty first run). Builder summary: ${build}`, { agentType: 'reviewer', phase: 'Review', label: 'reviewer', schema: VERDICT })

